reference/SLT-REF-01-renewal-timeline-offsets-from-next-payment-date-order-sub-st.md:47:| ↳ | `RenewalProcessor::process()` gates: not externally billed, status ∈ {active,trial,on-hold}, not waiting-cancellation, **`isRenewalDue()` requires `strtotime(_next_payment_date) <= time()`** | `RenewalProcessor.php:271-304`, `isRenewalDue()` at `:530-542` |
